{
  "about": "fabric-dashboard/0.1 declaration vectors (DEC-0036, DEC-0059): what a host takes from a well-known document's dashboard declaration. A present but invalid declaration is treated as not declared and reported (ED-9). hostView in src/dashboard-declaration.ts runs them; a host's port runs the same cases. `errors` are the validator's own and are not compared. A case with `wellKnownJson` gives the document as raw JSON text, because the number form matters there: a port parses that text as its host would, instead of reading `wellKnown`.",
